E=[('Redline 23 · pray for wisdom', 282,
 'End by asking the Holy Spirit for the gift of counsel, that tomorrow you would see what love requires, and have the courage to do it.',
 'End by asking the Holy Spirit for the gift of counsel, that tomorrow you would see what love requires, and have the courage to do it. And do not let a day pass without asking God for wisdom. It is one of the most neglected prayers of our time, and one He has promised to answer (cf. James 1:5).')]
